# .dockerignore — trims the `docker build` context sent to the daemon.
#
# The first-party image Dockerfiles (built by `oap build` and `mage
# desktop:images`) do `COPY . .` from the repo root, so anything NOT excluded
# here is uploaded as build context on every image build. The desktop bundle's
# build outputs alone are ~13GB (a 10GB rootfs.img, a 10GB oap.app, a ~200MB
# image tarball) plus a ~766MB download cache. None of the entries below are
# needed to compile the Go binaries or embed webd's (already built + committed)
# frontend dist.
#
# NOTE: source, go.mod/go.sum, and go:embed'd assets (e.g.
# pkg/web/webui/webassets/dist, the embedded install.yaml) live under pkg/,
# internal/ (the cluster-component binaries the service images build) and cmd/
# (the oap CLI), and are deliberately NOT excluded.

# --- Git ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# --- Dev tooling / agent worktrees + plugin cache (the multi-GB offender) ---
.claude/
.superpowers/
.worktrees/

# --- Desktop bundle build artifacts + upstream download cache (multi-GB) ---
# rootfs.img, oap.app, images-minimal.tar.zst, the ed25519 guest key, the Ubuntu
# cloud image + k3s downloads — never part of an image build.
build/desktop/out/
build/desktop/cache/

# --- Frontend dependency trees (webd embeds the committed dist under pkg/) ---
**/node_modules/

# --- Narrative docs — not needed to build any binary ---
docs/
.github/

# --- Stray compiled binaries occasionally left at the repo root (~100MB each) ---
/oap
/apguest
/operator
/channelsd
/webd
/runner
/identityd
/authzd
/toolspec
/claudeshim
/bin/

# --- OS / editor / test junk ---
**/.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*.log
*.out
*.test
coverage.txt
